name begingreek
category Package
revision 63255
shortdesc Greek environment to be used with pdfLaTeX only
longdesc This simple package defines a greek environment to be used with
longdesc pdfLaTeX only, that accepts an optional Greek font family name
longdesc to type its contents with. A similar \greektxt command does a
longdesc similar action for shorter texts.
